      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)With no dispersal reagent, the result is a draught. **Splash** bursts at impact; **gas** and **liquid** travel through the world and repeatedly touch nearby targets. Extent widens the affected area, while lifetime keeps moving brews active longer.[#]()",
      "title": "Dispersal",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
